  "guardrail_units": "Fresh p95/p99 are medians of per-attempt percentiles on each arm's clean attempts. All first attempts contribute failures and reopens. Process CPU-s/GiB uses scored payload and whole-invocation CPU. Runnable and wait use thread-seconds per bracket second.",
